A '''scoreboard''' can be found inside the [[Tombs of Amascut]]'s lobby. It shows several personal stats related to the tombs, including attempts, completions, deaths, as well as their corresponding global statistics, and fastest completion times for teams of 1-8 players.

As of [[1 October]] [[2026]], the following table shows the global attempts, completions, and deaths for all modes of the Tombs of Amascut.

